Rule 2 (exponent must be non-negative for integer base tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 5 then v_2 ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (negative exponents require floating-point or complex base tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 then 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
