Rule 5 (input array dimensions must be non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 7 (base tensor must not be boolean or string type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 11
>>
Rule 8 (base tensor dimensions must be strictly positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 12 (negative exponent requires floating-point or complex type while non-negative exponent allows any numerical type)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 then 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10 else 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
