Rule 13 (for negative exponents, base tensor values must be non-zero to prevent division by zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 then min(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 14 (for negative exponents, base tensor must avoid zero elements to prevent division by zero)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 then min(v_1) > 0 ∨ max(v_1) < 0
