Rule 16 (negative exponent requires floating-point or complex base tensor with non-zero values)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 then dtype_(v_1) ≥ 6 ∧ min(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ max(v_1) ≠ 0
